WEBVTT

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:09.940
Hunt them to extinction!

00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:14.250
Those in Lutiel's fleet 
are now under my command.

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:16.030
Charge the vanguard!

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:28.170
I am less than amused by 
their assault on the gate.

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:19.440
"Alea Iacta Est"

00:02:15.160 --> 00:02:18.340
It will take six hours for the 
Straggle Laser to fully recharge.

00:02:18.750 --> 00:02:21.910
We'll need to devise a 
plan to tide us over.

00:02:21.910 --> 00:02:23.470
But none of our attacks have been

00:02:23.470 --> 00:02:24.950
effective against them in the past.

00:02:25.340 --> 00:02:29.350
Maximize the rate of convergence 
to increase penetration.

00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:31.810
Blue 1's attack has already proven

00:02:31.810 --> 00:02:34.250
that physical rounds should 
be capable of penetrating

00:02:34.250 --> 00:02:35.250
the high-energy barrier.

00:02:35.870 --> 00:02:37.930
I suggest we take the initiative

00:02:37.930 --> 00:02:40.190
and hit them with a saturation attack

00:02:40.190 --> 00:02:41.940
to cripple their defense network and

00:02:41.940 --> 00:02:43.230
destroy the gate's control system.

00:02:43.740 --> 00:02:44.590
Permission granted!

00:02:45.530 --> 00:02:46.950
The Star Rose and the fleet ships

00:02:46.950 --> 00:02:49.060
will launch a controlled 
artillery attack.

00:02:49.490 --> 00:02:53.650
Roger. I will link all of our fleet's 
sublight-speed guided missiles.

00:02:55.620 --> 00:02:56.570
Link established!

00:02:57.330 --> 00:02:58.200
Excellent.

00:02:58.570 --> 00:03:01.230
Fire all of our sublight-speed 
guided missiles!

00:03:06.670 --> 00:03:08.180
The sublight-speed guided missiles have

00:03:08.180 --> 00:03:09.930
entered their second stage acceleration.

00:03:09.930 --> 00:03:11.800
Missile impact in 30 seconds!

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:16.280
All of the sublight-speed guided 
missiles have been destroyed!

00:03:21.270 --> 00:03:23.140
That is Lumes' unit.

00:03:23.690 --> 00:03:26.120
They have the tightest 
defenses amongst the Wulgaru.

00:03:26.360 --> 00:03:29.070
They destroyed all of those guided 
missiles in a split second...

00:03:29.070 --> 00:03:31.060
So a long-range battle has 
been rendered impossible?

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:31.770
Yes.

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:34.980
The 1st and 2nd Area Fleets' 
rate of attrition is at 45%!

00:03:35.330 --> 00:03:37.920
The Bela-Russian and the 
Great Chinese Alliance's

00:03:37.920 --> 00:03:39.380
fleets have begun to pull back.

00:03:39.380 --> 00:03:40.950
All fleets, tighten your formation!

00:03:41.170 --> 00:03:43.280
Anyone who pulls away from the 
main fleet will get picked off!

00:03:43.670 --> 00:03:45.290
But the Straggle Laser and our

00:03:45.290 --> 00:03:48.300
saturation attack with sublight 
guided missiles ended in failure.

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:50.380
We'll have to land a direct hit...

00:03:50.680 --> 00:03:53.830
Information on Team 
Rabbits... just came in!

00:03:58.640 --> 00:04:00.630
No matter how many I shoot, 
there's still more of 'em!

00:04:01.060 --> 00:04:03.130
They have us completely surrounded.

00:04:03.270 --> 00:04:05.070
My ammunition is down to 15%!

00:04:05.400 --> 00:04:07.550
I'm just about outta energy!

00:04:07.870 --> 00:04:10.060
Move it, you lowly insects!

00:04:10.280 --> 00:04:12.640
It makes me sick how you're 
swarming everywhere!

00:04:13.240 --> 00:04:14.170
Guys...

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:18.940
If you refuse to show yourself,

00:04:19.290 --> 00:04:21.270
I will force you to come out of hiding.

00:04:22.330 --> 00:04:25.530
Blue 1's remaining 
energy is down to 25%.

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:27.430
Rose 3 is down to 18%.

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:29.550
It will be difficult for 
them to continue fighting.

00:04:30.170 --> 00:04:32.040
Have them pull back, restock and refuel.

00:04:32.510 --> 00:04:35.010
This is the Godinion. 
Do you read, Kitty?

00:04:35.010 --> 00:04:36.680
I repeat, this is the Godinion.

00:04:36.680 --> 00:04:37.710
Meow, I hear ya!

00:04:38.060 --> 00:04:39.630
All units are to return for now.

00:04:42.350 --> 00:04:43.620
I'm confirming the route.

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:47.010
Retreat through Points 21-AF through EM.

00:04:47.360 --> 00:04:48.570
I'll transfer the data.

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:51.770
Pull back while I keep 'em busy 
with some diversionary shots!

00:04:52.070 --> 00:04:52.930
Roger!

00:04:53.240 --> 00:04:53.820
All units-

00:04:54.620 --> 00:04:55.290
Look out!

00:04:56.720 --> 00:04:58.650
There is a rapidly approaching 
high speed heat source!

00:04:59.040 --> 00:05:00.270
Tamaki, run for it!

00:05:01.750 --> 00:05:02.570
What happened?!

00:05:08.380 --> 00:05:09.670
It's that fighter from way back...!

00:05:12.840 --> 00:05:14.680
He's dangerous! Get out 
of there, Big Brother!

00:05:14.680 --> 00:05:16.580
You heard him, Big Brother!

00:05:17.510 --> 00:05:19.500
Verification on the 
hostile object: Complete!

00:05:20.890 --> 00:05:22.430
It's the guy from Ceres!

00:05:23.980 --> 00:05:25.310
He's blocking our escape route.

00:05:25.310 --> 00:05:26.220
Are there any other routes?

00:05:26.830 --> 00:05:29.280
We'd have to cut straight through 
the middle of the enemy's fleet.

00:05:29.610 --> 00:05:30.840
This sucks...

00:05:30.840 --> 00:05:32.540
Why are you acting like wusses?!

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:33.720
It's just a single fighter!

00:05:33.950 --> 00:05:36.760
I'm sure we'll manage somehow 
if everyone goes after him.

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:38.400
I guess that's our only option...

00:05:38.910 --> 00:05:40.370
Kei, navigate!

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:42.470
Suruga, offer backup support!

00:05:42.470 --> 00:05:43.320
Roger!

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:45.770
Tamaki, take the front of the Kette.

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:47.850
Ange, take the support position.

00:05:47.850 --> 00:05:48.660
Roger!

00:05:49.420 --> 00:05:50.920
Okay! Charge!

00:05:50.920 --> 00:05:53.960
I may have lost my boosters, 
but I still have my weapons!

00:05:57.600 --> 00:05:59.220
Leave him to me!

00:06:03.180 --> 00:06:04.130
He's in position!

00:06:06.600 --> 00:06:08.050
He dodged that?

00:06:10.230 --> 00:06:10.900
Damn it!

00:06:10.920 --> 00:06:11.760
I'm not done yet!

00:06:12.280 --> 00:06:13.180
Big Brother!

00:06:15.320 --> 00:06:16.820
How much energy do they have left?

00:06:16.820 --> 00:06:19.060
Blue 1 is at 1.9%.

00:06:19.410 --> 00:06:21.340
He can't even get back off that...

00:06:21.660 --> 00:06:23.540
Should we send him a booster?

00:06:23.540 --> 00:06:24.320
Can we?

00:06:24.710 --> 00:06:26.080
The preparations are already complete,

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:28.820
but I'm not sure the enemy will 
give him enough time to dock...

00:06:29.210 --> 00:06:30.660
What are his chances of 
successfully docking?

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:32.920
43.8%.

00:06:33.550 --> 00:06:35.080
It beats doing nothing and watching him

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:36.640
get cut down when he runs out of energy.

00:06:36.980 --> 00:06:37.930
Launch it!

00:06:37.930 --> 00:06:38.750
Roger!

00:06:40.890 --> 00:06:43.880
Asagi, your booster is 
coming. Dock with it!

00:06:44.530 --> 00:06:45.590
Roger!

00:06:45.770 --> 00:06:47.270
Ange, fill in for me right quick!

00:06:47.560 --> 00:06:49.910
Sure thing! Suruga, back me up!

00:06:50.420 --> 00:06:51.590
She finally said my name!

00:06:51.690 --> 00:06:53.190
Hurry it up, ya damn bug!

00:06:53.190 --> 00:06:55.350
I'll help you out!

00:07:05.230 --> 00:07:06.030
Reinforcements!

00:07:08.370 --> 00:07:10.150
To think that I would feel the urge to

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:12.090
immerse myself in the 
hunt after all this time!

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:15.570
I never expected Dolgana to 
personally enter the fray!

00:07:17.030 --> 00:07:19.030
He is the Wulgaru's greatest general.

00:07:22.090 --> 00:07:22.850
Ange!

00:07:24.430 --> 00:07:25.130
Shit!

00:07:25.560 --> 00:07:27.240
I'll deal with this bogey!

00:07:37.040 --> 00:07:38.560
My unit's heavy!

00:07:38.700 --> 00:07:39.980
Damn it all to hell!

00:07:43.530 --> 00:07:45.760
Blue 1, you're down 
to 3% residual energy.

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:48.400
You're at risk if you keep fighting!

00:07:51.420 --> 00:07:53.390
Cut power to my left arm!

00:07:53.390 --> 00:07:54.390
Pull back!

00:07:54.390 --> 00:07:56.530
Until we defeat this guy, 
that's not an option!

00:07:57.050 --> 00:07:59.080
Are there any surplus forces?

00:07:59.080 --> 00:07:59.940
No, ma'am!

00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:01.540
What weapons do we have 
left on this vessel?

00:08:02.190 --> 00:08:04.640
Just a multipurpose short-range 
guided missile launcher.

00:08:04.640 --> 00:08:06.760
It doesn't have the range you need.

00:08:08.890 --> 00:08:10.170
I'll go.

00:08:11.950 --> 00:08:16.260
But the next time you get in that 
AHSMB unit, it could kill you!

00:08:17.400 --> 00:08:20.620
Everyone is out there fighting 
their hardest so you don't have to.

00:08:21.110 --> 00:08:22.770
Are you going to put 
their efforts to waste?

00:08:23.320 --> 00:08:24.990
That may be true, but I...

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:27.950
I'm ordering you to 
wait in your quarters.

00:08:28.540 --> 00:08:29.820
Peko, escort him.

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:30.990
Captain Suzukaze!

00:08:32.210 --> 00:08:34.070
I love you.

00:08:34.460 --> 00:08:35.240
Wha-?!

00:08:35.460 --> 00:08:36.530
Reika,

00:08:36.850 --> 00:08:38.170
Siegfried,

00:08:38.510 --> 00:08:39.580
Guiliano,

00:08:39.920 --> 00:08:40.620
Peko,

00:08:41.180 --> 00:08:42.500
Natori Shion,

00:08:43.050 --> 00:08:44.130
Degawa,

00:08:44.130 --> 00:08:45.230
Mayu,

00:08:45.230 --> 00:08:46.000
Dan,

00:08:46.510 --> 00:08:48.180
everyone on the pit crew,

00:08:49.140 --> 00:08:50.490
Commander Simon,

00:08:50.490 --> 00:08:51.710
Teoria,

00:08:52.020 --> 00:08:52.980
Kei,

00:08:52.980 --> 00:08:53.900
Tamaki,

00:08:53.900 --> 00:08:54.810
Ange,

00:08:54.810 --> 00:08:56.070
Suruga,

00:08:56.150 --> 00:08:57.690
and my big brother, Asagi,

00:08:58.280 --> 00:09:00.100
I love all of you!

00:09:01.150 --> 00:09:03.130
I was born all by myself,

00:09:03.130 --> 00:09:04.940
never knowing what my parents look like.

00:09:05.370 --> 00:09:09.270
But now I have a family 
and I love so many people!

00:09:09.660 --> 00:09:11.250
I can't die for their sake...

00:09:11.660 --> 00:09:12.690
And besides...

00:09:13.920 --> 00:09:14.860
And besides,

00:09:15.680 --> 00:09:17.820
I still have a bunch of 
manga that I want to draw!

00:09:19.170 --> 00:09:21.470
So I'm not going to die!

00:09:22.930 --> 00:09:23.790
Probably...

00:09:24.010 --> 00:09:25.470
"Probably," he says.

00:09:25.470 --> 00:09:28.250
Well, it's just like him to fall flat.

00:09:28.390 --> 00:09:31.110
Isn't this when you're supposed 
to give up and let him go?

00:09:31.110 --> 00:09:34.400
You'll have to pardon me, but 
considering our current situation,

00:09:34.400 --> 00:09:36.320
I believe it will be difficult to turn

00:09:36.320 --> 00:09:38.760
the tables without dispatching Red 5.

00:09:40.360 --> 00:09:41.600
Go get 'em.

00:09:41.940 --> 00:09:44.650
That's easy for you to say!
 His unit is currently locked...

00:09:44.650 --> 00:09:45.700
He can go whenever he's ready!

00:09:45.700 --> 00:09:47.310
It's all warmed up!

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:49.080
You can take it to full power!

00:09:51.620 --> 00:09:54.490
All right, then. Red 
5, prepare to sortie.

00:09:55.540 --> 00:09:56.970
You'd better come back to us!

00:09:57.380 --> 00:09:58.170
Yes, ma'am!

00:10:12.640 --> 00:10:13.420
Blast off!

00:10:22.190 --> 00:10:23.310
We're counting on you...

00:10:24.360 --> 00:10:25.610
So you've finally come.

00:10:29.160 --> 00:10:29.910
Izuru?!

00:10:29.910 --> 00:10:31.900
Dude, what're you doin' here?!

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:34.440
We told you to keep out of 
this, you freakin' moron!

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:35.940
You stoopy-poopy head!

00:10:36.330 --> 00:10:39.110
We told you to take it 
easy and stay on the ship!

00:10:39.380 --> 00:10:40.340
I'll be fine.

00:10:40.790 --> 00:10:43.550
After all, I'm the hero... probably.

00:10:43.550 --> 00:10:45.190
What's with that, "probably"?!

00:10:45.480 --> 00:10:48.120
I've been eagerly awaiting 
your arrival, my lamata!

00:10:48.300 --> 00:10:50.290
Guys, withdraw while you still can!

00:10:54.480 --> 00:10:55.500
Roger...!

00:11:09.570 --> 00:11:11.910
The Great Chinese Alliance 
is currently fleeing!

00:11:11.910 --> 00:11:14.570
Bela-Russia is maintaining their 
battle formation as they skirt back.

00:11:14.950 --> 00:11:17.290
Africa's forces are in chaos!

00:11:17.290 --> 00:11:21.490
The 1st Area Fleet's frontline 
rate of attrition is at 64.9%!

00:11:21.790 --> 00:11:23.210
How do things look for the Rabbits?

00:11:23.210 --> 00:11:24.160
I'll put it on the screen!

00:11:27.220 --> 00:11:29.320
So their hands are tied, too.

00:11:29.760 --> 00:11:32.790
Fire all of the main cannons 
simultaneously at Point DN-31!

00:11:32.970 --> 00:11:35.120
While we're doing that, have 
the 1st and 2nd Fleets

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:36.230
retreat at full speed.

00:11:38.390 --> 00:11:40.090
The enemy is quickly closing in on us!

00:11:40.550 --> 00:11:42.590
I don't care if we burn 
out all of our cannons!

00:11:42.590 --> 00:11:44.260
Fire! Fire! Fire like mad!

00:11:44.820 --> 00:11:46.100
There are too many of them!

00:11:48.280 --> 00:11:49.810
Enemy fighters are advancing.

00:11:49.810 --> 00:11:50.680
What's the situation?

00:11:51.160 --> 00:11:54.790
They'll get to start firing at us 
long before they enter our range.

00:11:54.790 --> 00:11:56.900
This is bad... Can you handle this?

00:11:56.900 --> 00:11:58.170
Please leave everything to us!

00:11:58.250 --> 00:12:00.600
My dream is to lead a carefree 
life living off pension,

00:12:00.600 --> 00:12:02.310
so I'll push myself a bit.

00:12:02.310 --> 00:12:04.740
I'm sending you all of the enemy's 
verified locations and past maneuvers.

00:12:05.130 --> 00:12:08.170
Roger. After calculating their 
anticipated movement patterns,

00:12:08.170 --> 00:12:10.800
I'm going to pull out everything 
from the top to 1024.

00:12:10.800 --> 00:12:13.680
Inputting random firing coefficients 
for the anticipated patterns.

00:12:13.970 --> 00:12:15.530
I've indicated that the ship 
is to prioritize safety

00:12:15.530 --> 00:12:17.170
while also eliminating 
any margin of error.

00:12:17.470 --> 00:12:19.710
If we drop the safety margin by 0.2,

00:12:19.710 --> 00:12:22.910
the evasion rate goes up 14.72%.

00:12:22.910 --> 00:12:24.130
How would that affect the safety?

00:12:24.270 --> 00:12:26.050
I'm guessing we'll lose 
our kitchen plates

00:12:26.050 --> 00:12:28.460
and suffer muscle pain in the morning.

00:12:28.460 --> 00:12:29.570
Then do it.

00:12:29.570 --> 00:12:32.230
Roger! I'm sending over 
the pilot control data.

00:12:32.360 --> 00:12:34.690
Our vessel will begin 
taking evasive measures!

00:12:34.950 --> 00:12:37.430
All crew, you have 20 
seconds to brace yourselves

00:12:37.430 --> 00:12:39.080
and prepare for turbulence!

00:12:39.080 --> 00:12:41.920
We're down to 10 seconds!
 Pilot controls are set for full auto!

00:12:43.180 --> 00:12:44.030
Five,

00:12:44.630 --> 00:12:45.360
four,

00:12:45.920 --> 00:12:46.780
three,

00:12:47.300 --> 00:12:48.380
two,

00:12:48.840 --> 00:12:49.740
one!

00:12:50.220 --> 00:12:50.950
Accelerate!

00:12:57.560 --> 00:12:59.550
The evasive pattern is 
within permissible range!

00:12:59.730 --> 00:13:03.170
It's a good thing they're drawing the 
big shots' attention away from us.

00:13:03.400 --> 00:13:05.050
Fire all weapons!

00:13:13.670 --> 00:13:14.790
He's faster than before!

00:13:16.740 --> 00:13:18.660
If I don't stop him here and now...!

00:13:22.120 --> 00:13:23.000
Crap!

00:13:26.840 --> 00:13:27.740
What?!

00:13:32.050 --> 00:13:33.030
Just now...

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:39.080
Please send me fuel, ammunition, 
a left arm and a booster pod!

00:13:39.220 --> 00:13:40.720
They're ready to go!

00:13:40.720 --> 00:13:42.090
I just gotta input your coordinates.

00:13:42.350 --> 00:13:44.680
I should have known. 
Please send them over.

00:13:44.680 --> 00:13:47.340
Knowing you, don't freak out 
and screw up the docking.

00:13:47.900 --> 00:13:49.050
Change the parts, quick!

00:13:49.560 --> 00:13:51.280
We're all out of spare boosters.

00:13:51.280 --> 00:13:52.100
Now what?

00:13:52.280 --> 00:13:54.850
I don't care what you 
do, just do something!

00:14:00.580 --> 00:14:01.660
Now I remember...

00:14:08.710 --> 00:14:10.190
That's right.

00:14:10.190 --> 00:14:12.910
I shouldn't suppress the 
AHSMB's survival instinct...

00:14:16.090 --> 00:14:18.680
Rather than defy its survival instinct,

00:14:18.680 --> 00:14:20.500
I should provide it directionality!

00:14:21.470 --> 00:14:22.170
That's it!

00:14:22.780 --> 00:14:24.590
Let me see more of what you can do!

00:14:24.770 --> 00:14:27.090
You're just a stinking big bug!

00:14:27.400 --> 00:14:28.740
The way you keep scurrying 
here and there,

00:14:28.740 --> 00:14:30.550
you must be a cockroach!

00:14:30.770 --> 00:14:32.850
Let me squish you already!

00:14:33.190 --> 00:14:35.390
Damn it! Why can't I hit him?!

00:14:37.240 --> 00:14:39.070
Escort vessel Takanami, destroyed.

00:14:39.740 --> 00:14:42.090
Close-Support Fleet down to 21 ships!

00:14:42.610 --> 00:14:44.750
Our vessel's firing capabilities 
are down to 12%.

00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:48.130
We've lost our armor plating 
from Block 1 to Block 3.

00:14:48.130 --> 00:14:50.030
The engine is still capable 
of working at maximum power!

00:14:50.500 --> 00:14:52.430
It will take another 
eight minutes for the

00:14:52.430 --> 00:14:53.800
1st and 2nd Fleets to reorganize.

00:14:53.800 --> 00:14:55.800
The Great Chinese Alliance 
and Bela-Russian's army

00:14:55.800 --> 00:14:57.260
are out of our sensor's range.

00:14:57.260 --> 00:14:59.350
How long before the Straggle 
Laser is fully charged?

00:14:59.350 --> 00:15:01.000
It will be ready in ten minutes!

00:15:01.590 --> 00:15:03.220
No matter what the cost,

00:15:03.220 --> 00:15:05.300
we must destroy that 
gate's control system!

00:15:06.060 --> 00:15:07.440
Engine at full power!

00:15:07.440 --> 00:15:09.800
Have the remaining fleets 
enter Code: Fish Formation!

00:15:10.520 --> 00:15:11.610
Prepare to charge!

00:15:14.190 --> 00:15:16.850
Our ship will now break through the 
center of the enemy's formation...

00:15:17.150 --> 00:15:18.180
and head for the gate!

00:15:20.070 --> 00:15:21.100
Tally-ho!

00:15:21.490 --> 00:15:22.990
The cavalry has arrived!

00:15:23.290 --> 00:15:24.190
Doberman...?

00:15:24.660 --> 00:15:26.420
I'm part of Doberman 2 now.

00:15:26.870 --> 00:15:28.070
All units, charge!

00:15:31.390 --> 00:15:33.080
Those are the mass-produced AHSMB units!

00:15:35.760 --> 00:15:37.410
The enemy vanguard is pulling back!

00:15:41.160 --> 00:15:43.550
Retrieving those units made us run late.

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:47.420
Pulling back to lure the enemy in 
is a traditional tactic of ours.

00:15:47.430 --> 00:15:49.120
Now is the time for a counterattack!

00:15:49.120 --> 00:15:52.250
There is nowhere for 
us to go but forward!

00:15:52.250 --> 00:15:55.030
The 1st and 2nd Fleets 
have finished regrouping!

00:15:55.030 --> 00:15:56.560
All fleets, advance!

00:15:56.560 --> 00:15:58.180
We will seize the gate 
in one fell swoop!

00:15:58.860 --> 00:16:00.550
Remaining distance: 20%.

00:16:00.550 --> 00:16:02.270
The gate is within firing range!

00:16:02.830 --> 00:16:04.740
All ships, concentrate 
your fire on the gate!

00:16:04.740 --> 00:16:06.940
Hit it with everything you've got!

00:16:07.200 --> 00:16:09.610
All units, open your 
fields to maximum output.

00:16:14.840 --> 00:16:16.240
Clear them out.

00:16:16.800 --> 00:16:18.160
They blocked our attack?!

00:16:18.420 --> 00:16:19.800
Here comes the counterattack!

00:16:19.800 --> 00:16:21.220
Enter shock-absorbing 
defensive positions!

00:16:23.390 --> 00:16:24.510
Damage report!

00:16:25.310 --> 00:16:27.290
Go! Go! Go! Go! Go!

00:16:29.770 --> 00:16:31.170
I'm not done yet!

00:16:35.730 --> 00:16:38.930
Big Brother and Teoria...

00:16:39.240 --> 00:16:40.890
Give me the power to protect everyone!

00:16:41.610 --> 00:16:43.910
Izuru Hitachi's Harmonic 
Level is rising.

00:16:44.420 --> 00:16:46.270
Red 5 has reached maximum output.

00:16:51.710 --> 00:16:53.600
Contacting Rada and Klein's squad.

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:55.770
Prepare to fire at full power.

00:16:55.770 --> 00:16:57.620
Annihilate the enemy 
with that one attack!

00:16:58.050 --> 00:17:00.260
Forces have decreased by 21%.

00:17:00.550 --> 00:17:02.830
We've lost our armor 
plating up to Block 5!

00:17:03.010 --> 00:17:05.040
It's dangerous to continue 
participation in the battle!

00:17:05.410 --> 00:17:07.390
But we can't afford to stop now!

00:17:07.810 --> 00:17:08.960
Enemy reinforcements!

00:17:12.350 --> 00:17:14.170
How much longer before we 
can fire the Straggle Laser?

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:15.050
Five minutes!

00:17:15.520 --> 00:17:16.860
We're running out of time!

00:17:18.230 --> 00:17:20.710
We'll ram our ship into 
the gate's control system.

00:17:21.530 --> 00:17:23.110
All crew, prepare to abandon ship!

00:17:23.110 --> 00:17:24.280
Hold off on that!

00:17:24.820 --> 00:17:26.280
We'll hit it with this!

00:17:28.120 --> 00:17:29.450
But how?!

00:17:31.290 --> 00:17:32.900
Ta-da-da!

00:17:33.120 --> 00:17:34.780
Thanks for waiting!

00:17:43.050 --> 00:17:45.250
Klein's squad, attack 
the enemy vanguard.

00:17:45.590 --> 00:17:47.850
Rada's squad, serve as mobile 
defense on the flanks.

00:17:48.140 --> 00:17:49.210
Don't let them through!

00:17:49.930 --> 00:17:52.880
The Straggle Laser will be 
ready to fire in two minutes!

00:17:57.820 --> 00:17:59.230
Are you all right, Asagi?

00:17:59.570 --> 00:18:01.930
"Yeah, this is nothing,"

00:18:02.360 --> 00:18:04.850
...or so I'd like to say, but 
there are too many of them.

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:10.690
It can't be...!

00:18:19.550 --> 00:18:20.880
Something just came out!

00:18:20.880 --> 00:18:22.360
It's a new model!

00:18:22.360 --> 00:18:25.010
People of Wulgaru, listen to me.

00:18:25.630 --> 00:18:26.710
My name is...

00:18:27.390 --> 00:18:30.880
My name is Pleguzesia Teoria.

00:18:31.720 --> 00:18:34.640
I am a descendant of the great Dakihaan

00:18:34.640 --> 00:18:36.510
as well as one who shares the

00:18:36.510 --> 00:18:39.550
genes of the rightful ruler 
of the galaxy, Eguzes Galkie.

00:18:40.570 --> 00:18:42.220
Those who hear my voice,

00:18:43.030 --> 00:18:45.090
Pleguzesia Teoria orders you:

00:18:45.450 --> 00:18:47.060
Retreat immediately.

00:18:47.530 --> 00:18:48.730
Teoria?!

00:18:49.370 --> 00:18:50.480
She's pretty...

00:18:50.870 --> 00:18:52.410
She's like a goddess.

00:18:52.410 --> 00:18:54.020
Don't try to flirt with her.

00:18:54.330 --> 00:18:55.920
She waited for the best possible timing!

00:18:55.920 --> 00:18:57.440
You knew about this?

00:18:57.790 --> 00:18:59.860
You should have shown yourself sooner!

00:19:04.420 --> 00:19:05.410
Teoria?!

00:19:05.630 --> 00:19:06.660
Teoria!

00:19:08.260 --> 00:19:09.250
Not happening!

00:19:09.720 --> 00:19:11.790
I swear I will protect Teoria!

00:19:17.810 --> 00:19:20.060
I never expected that I 
would take you seriously...

00:19:20.860 --> 00:19:23.300
Hear the throbbing pulse of my genes!

00:19:26.150 --> 00:19:27.140
Like I'm gonna let you get away!

00:19:27.530 --> 00:19:30.310
Damn it! You're a lame coward the 
way you're so freaking quick to run!

00:19:32.990 --> 00:19:34.570
What a pity!

00:19:35.060 --> 00:19:37.400
You shoulda gotten 
here sooner, slowpoke!

00:19:37.830 --> 00:19:39.240
We're going to hit him from both sides.

00:19:39.240 --> 00:19:41.460
Stay out of my line of fire!

00:19:41.460 --> 00:19:42.740
Don't order me around!

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:50.080
You are doing this of your 
own free will, aren't you?

00:19:57.630 --> 00:19:58.780
What's goin' on?

00:19:59.020 --> 00:20:01.720
A path to our goal just opened up.
 Charge full speed ahead!

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:03.180
Roger that!

00:20:03.430 --> 00:20:06.350
What are you doing?!
Everyone, return to your posts!

00:20:08.570 --> 00:20:10.260
You're up against me!

00:20:10.260 --> 00:20:13.060
Don't forget about me! 
Stay in formation.

00:20:13.060 --> 00:20:16.040
I already told you, 
don't order me around!

00:20:17.200 --> 00:20:18.960
Release the final safety lock.

00:20:18.960 --> 00:20:20.580
Rate of convergence: 500.

00:20:25.710 --> 00:20:27.330
Go!

00:20:28.070 --> 00:20:29.220
I'm counting on you!

00:20:29.220 --> 00:20:30.540
Tamaki, come back!

00:20:31.300 --> 00:20:32.340
Roger!

00:20:36.220 --> 00:20:39.550
Nine, eight, seven,

00:20:40.140 --> 00:20:43.300
six, five, four,

00:20:43.880 --> 00:20:46.100
three, two!

00:20:49.320 --> 00:20:50.430
We did it!

00:20:50.700 --> 00:20:52.770
Fire the Straggle Laser!

00:21:07.670 --> 00:21:08.850
Will this do it?

00:21:10.300 --> 00:21:12.180
The Straggle Laser has been hit!

00:21:15.100 --> 00:21:16.960
Isn't that... Dolgana's unit?

00:21:17.640 --> 00:21:20.220
The Straggle Laser has 
been completely destroyed.

00:21:21.440 --> 00:21:24.480
We've... run out of options.

00:21:25.560 --> 00:21:27.510
No, we still have one left.

00:21:34.370 --> 00:21:36.370
He's completely awoken...?

00:21:36.830 --> 00:21:40.020
The awakened Red 5 will 
illuminate the path.

00:21:40.620 --> 00:21:43.530
We will hit the gate with the largest 
body of mobile mass we have.

00:21:43.870 --> 00:21:45.020
Roger!

00:21:45.710 --> 00:21:47.340
All crew, quickly abandon 
the ship from both sides-

00:21:47.340 --> 00:21:48.700
Amane's ship is to stay as it is!

00:21:49.300 --> 00:21:53.120
The Star Rose's crew is to 
abandon ship on the double!

00:21:53.840 --> 00:21:56.420
I'm going to ram the 
Star Rose into the gate.

00:23:40.910 --> 00:23:55.910
"Flowers Falling in Space"
